Package: argon-oneup-suite
Version: 1.3.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: argon-oneup-essentials (>= 1.3.1), argon-oneup-backlight (>= 1.3.1), argon-oneup-battery (>= 1.3.1), argon-oneup-lid (>= 1.3.1), argon-oneup-sensors (>= 1.3.1), argon-power-profiles (>= 1.3.1)
Suggests: rpi-fake-sleep (>= 1.3.1), cm5-mmc-fix (>= 1.3.1), argon-oneup-plasma-widget (>= 1.3.1), ksystemstats-rpi5-fix (>= 1.3.1), rpi-pishutdown (>= 1.3.1), argon-wfplug-batt (>= 1.3.1)
Description: Complete hardware support suite for Argon ONE UP laptop
 Metapackage that installs all core hardware drivers, services, and utilities for the
 Argon ONE UP laptop (based on Raspberry Pi 5 / Compute Module 5).
 Includes hardware essentials (antenna, NVMe Gen 3, USB host, 2.8 GHz boost, fan curve),
 battery telemetry (CW2217), DDC/CI display backlight, magnetic lid switch,
 power profiles daemon, and standard lm-sensors hardware configuration.
 Fully system-agnostic: works across all Linux distributions and desktop environments.
 Optional extensions (Fake-Sleep, CM5 MMC fix, KDE widgets, and Pi OS dialogs)
 are available as separate packages in extras.
